    {
      "id": "8f417f73be3b5afdbd9e",
      "name": "Insights & Actions",
      "visuals": [
        {
          "key": "title",
          "name": "1df95ffee8f75579a5e6",
          "type": "textbox",
          "x": 16,
          "y": 6,
          "w": 900,
          "h": 68,
          "text": [
            "Insights & Actions",
            "Four evidence-based actions for HR and L&D. Cards are live; details in 04_Docs/Insights_and_Recommendations.md."
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "card_Overtime Attrition Ratio",
          "name": "a5e053cf0c675fac8357",
          "type": "card",
          "x": 16.0,
          "y": 80,
          "w": 303.0,
          "h": 92,
          "measures": [
            "Overtime Attrition Ratio"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "card_Early Tenure Attrition Rate (0-1 yrs)",
          "name": "5077315b8abd5be08c12",
          "type": "card",
          "x": 331.0,
          "y": 80,
          "w": 303.0,
          "h": 92,
          "measures": [
            "Early Tenure Attrition Rate (0-1 yrs)"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "card_Attrition Rate - Low Job Satisfaction",
          "name": "5b75477975185c39b69e",
          "type": "card",
          "x": 646.0,
          "y": 80,
          "w": 303.0,
          "h": 92,
          "measures": [
            "Attrition Rate - Low Job Satisfaction"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "card_Company Attrition Rate",
          "name": "f6cedf8db9e3595d88f0",
          "type": "card",
          "x": 961.0,
          "y": 80,
          "w": 303.0,
          "h": 92,
          "measures": [
            "Company Attrition Rate"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "panel1",
          "name": "c1068199a8dd50ffb50d",
          "type": "textbox",
          "x": 16.0,
          "y": 184,
          "w": 618.0,
          "h": 236,
          "text": [
            "1. Reduce sustained overtime",
            "Attrition 30.5% with overtime vs 10.4% without; holds after controlling for role, tenure and pay.",
            "Action: monthly overtime reviews, rebalance workload. Start with Sales Reps, Lab Technicians, HR, Research Scientists."
          ],
          "title": "1. Reduce sustained overtime"
        },
        {
          "key": "panel2",
          "name": "6ebec9b5ec21531f948f",
          "type": "textbox",
          "x": 646.0,
          "y": 184,
          "w": 618.0,
          "h": 236,
          "text": [
            "2. Make the first year stick",
            "34.9% of 0-1 year employees left (55.1% with overtime). New joiners get no extra training.",
            "Action: 90-day onboarding, mentor per new hire, front-loaded learning path, no routine overtime in year 1."
          ],
          "title": "2. Make the first year stick"
        },
        {
          "key": "panel3",
          "name": "01d5bac2f0b05eb5b624",
          "type": "textbox",
          "x": 16.0,
          "y": 432,
          "w": 618.0,
          "h": 236,
          "text": [
            "3. Retention plan for Sales Representatives",
            "39.8% attrition (+23.6 pts); 91.6% are level 1, avg income 2,626 vs 6,503.",
            "Action: pay and incentive benchmark, career path to Sales Executive, coaching."
          ],
          "title": "3. Retention plan for Sales Representatives"
        },
        {
          "key": "panel4",
          "name": "a7c48eb2bde65f6eadbb",
          "type": "textbox",
          "x": 646.0,
          "y": 432,
          "w": 618.0,
          "h": 236,
          "text": [
            "4. Act on engagement signals",
            "Low job satisfaction: 22.8% attrition; bad work-life balance: 31.3%.",
            "Action: quarterly pulse survey, manager follow-up within 30 days, flexible work options."
          ],
          "title": "4. Act on engagement signals"
        },
        {
          "key": "footnote",
          "name": "92a6e97bf9d35131ad08",
          "type": "textbox",
          "x": 16,
          "y": 680,
          "w": 1248,
          "h": 34,
          "text": [
            "Associations in a fictional snapshot (IBM sample), not proven causes - test actions with a pilot first. Also improve learning data: course type, hours, completion, dates. Full analysis: 04_Docs/Insights_and_Recommendations.md"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
